sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Operator or Director
    participant A as Control API
    participant K as Project Control Kernel
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant W as DurableExecutionPort / Hatchet
    participant X as External Adapter
    O->>A: Typed command + idempotency key
    A->>K: Authenticated action intent
    K->>P: Transaction: command ledger + state + outbox
    P-->>K: Commit
    K-->>A: Accepted command identity
    W->>P: Claim durable work
    W->>X: Idempotent external effect
    X-->>W: Outcome or unknown outcome
    W->>P: Persist result / reconciliation state
    K->>P: Recompute authoritative state
